{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4fd6b024-aeaf-4c0a-8e2d-efdf6479fb21",
    "name": "Convert4me",
    "description": "SOULMV PDF → Excel (NestJS).\n\n## Variáveis\n\nImporte `local.postman_environment.json`: **URL** (ex.: `http://localhost:3000`) e **Token** (Bearer Genesys, quando aplicável).\n\n## Converter PDF (upload)\n\n1. Body → **form-data** → **file** (tipo **File**) → selecione o PDF.\n2. Auth → Bearer → `{{Token}}` só é necessário no request **Converter PDF (Genesys)**.\n3. Use **Send and Download** para salvar o `.xlsx`.\n\nNão defina `Content-Type` manualmente; o Postman monta o multipart.\n\n## Converter PDF (Genesys)\n\nEnvie **conversationId** e **messageId** no form-data (sem arquivo); o serviço baixa o PDF via API Genesys.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Converter PDF",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{Token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": [],
              "description": "Relatório SOULMV (PDF)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/convert",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["convert"]
        },
        "description": "POST multipart com campo `file`. Resposta: arquivo `.xlsx`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Converter PDF (Genesys)",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{Token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "conversationId",
              "value": "",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "ID da conversa Genesys"
            },
            {
              "key": "messageId",
              "value": "",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "ID da mensagem de e-mail com o PDF"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/convert",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["convert"]
        },
        "description": "Sem upload de PDF: `conversationId` e `messageId` obrigatórios. Bearer token Genesys na aba Auth."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/health",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Health check. Resposta esperada: `{ \"message\": \"Ok\" }`."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
